[Desktop Entry]
Type=Service
Comment=Edit supported documents with Office on the web
Comment[cs]=Upravujte podporované dokumenty v Office na webu
Comment[de]=Unterstützte Dokumente mit Office im Web bearbeiten
Comment[es]=Editar documentos compatibles con Office en la web
Comment[fr]=Modifier les documents compatibles avec Office sur le web
Comment[it]=Modifica i documenti supportati con Office sul web
Comment[ja]=Office for the web で対応ドキュメントを編集
Comment[ko]=웹용 Office에서 지원되는 문서 편집
Comment[nl]=Ondersteunde documenten bewerken met Office op het web
Comment[pl]=Edytuj obsługiwane dokumenty w Office w internecie
Comment[pt_BR]=Editar documentos compatíveis com o Office na Web
Comment[ru]=Редактируйте поддерживаемые документы в Office в Интернете
Comment[sv]=Redigera dokument som stöds med Office på webben
Comment[tr]=Desteklenen belgeleri Office web'de düzenleyin
Comment[uk]=Редагуйте підтримувані документи в Office в Інтернеті
Comment[zh_CN]=使用 Office 网页版编辑支持的文档
MimeType=application/msword;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document;application/vnd.ms-word.document.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-excel;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet;application/vnd.ms-excel.sheet.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-powerpoint;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation;application/vnd.ms-powerpoint.presentation.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.spreadsheet;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.presentation;
Actions=officeOnline;
X-KDE-Submenu=OneDrive
X-KDE-Submenu[de]=OneDrive
X-KDE-Priority=TopLevel
Icon=drivedeck

[Desktop Action officeOnline]
Name=Edit in Office on the web
Name[cs]=Upravit v Office na webu
Name[de]=In Office im Web bearbeiten
Name[es]=Editar en Office en la web
Name[fr]=Modifier dans Office sur le web
Name[it]=Modifica in Office sul web
Name[ja]=Office for the web で編集
Name[ko]=웹용 Office에서 편집
Name[nl]=Bewerken in Office op het web
Name[pl]=Edytuj w Office w internecie
Name[pt_BR]=Editar no Office na Web
Name[ru]=Редактировать в Office в Интернете
Name[sv]=Redigera i Office på webben
Name[tr]=Office web'de düzenle
Name[uk]=Редагувати в Office в Інтернеті
Name[zh_CN]=在 Office 网页版中编辑
Icon=document-edit
Exec=drivedeck --office-online %f
